2️⃣ Thread Priority
🔹 What is Thread Priority?

Thread priority is a hint to the CPU scheduler about which thread is more important.
Java priority range:

1 → MIN_PRIORITY
5 → NORM_PRIORITY (default)
10 → MAX_PRIORITY

🔹 Why do we use Thread Priority
To give more importance to critical tasks
Background tasks → lower priority
Important tasks → higher priority

⚠️ Important:

Priority does not guarantee execution order, it only gives preference.

🔹 Real-Life Example
Hospital example:
Emergency patient → higher priority
Normal checkup → lower priority
